# Git Workflow: Quickmerge

RULE: Use `bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "message"` for all commits. Branch protection rejects direct push to main. Run quality gates before declaring work done; quickmerge runs them again.
WHY: Single workflow — dependency validation, quality gates, PR creation, auto-merge. Direct push rejected.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/quality-gates.md

DO:
  bash scripts/quickmerge.sh "feat: add X"  # omit --files to stage all
  bash git-quickmerge.sh "update" --all  # multiple repos

NEVER:
  git push origin main
  Finish with uncommitted changes in any modified repo
